  "顧客名": [
   {
    "quote": "Unveiled at Goodwood Festival of Speed, the Atom 4R takes the Honda Type-R turbocharged engine to 400bhp with torque increased to 500Nm. Coupled with a new paddle shift and sequential gearbox the Atom 4R is focussed on absolute ultimate road and track performance.",
    "url": "https://www.arielmotor.co.uk/our-history/",
    "pass": 1
   },
   {
    "quote": "is a small business that has a big impact. The company’s legendary cars have outperformed Ferraris and Lamborghinis, despite costing a fraction of the price.",
    "url": "https://resources.bethebusiness.com/real-business-stories/david-and-goliath-ariel-motor-company-has-succeeded-by-staying-small/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "“It's not just about producing something as efficiently and quickly as possible. Part of that is down to quality, because we want to keep our guys interested, and part of that is because the customers enjoy being able to come here and see their cars being made, which you couldn't do in a Nissan factory,” he said.",
    "url": "https://resources.bethebusiness.com/real-business-stories/david-and-goliath-ariel-motor-company-has-succeeded-by-staying-small/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Simon Saunders cut his automotive teeth as a designer for Porsche, Aston Martin and GM",
    "url": "https://resources.bethebusiness.com/real-business-stories/david-and-goliath-ariel-motor-company-has-succeeded-by-staying-small/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "The company builds around 120 vehicles every year, which is roughly what Honda produces every 20 minutes. However, staying small has its perks. Not only does it enable the company to create bespoke cars, offer a personalised experience and pivot easily, but it provides stability.",
    "url": "https://resources.bethebusiness.com/real-business-stories/david-and-goliath-ariel-motor-company-has-succeeded-by-staying-small/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
