    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "In 2003, the 2-liter Honda Civic Type R (for the 220) and Type-S (for the 160) engine was used to power the Atom 2. Introduced in 2007, the Atom 3 included a new gearbox and a \"KZ\" Type-R motor.",
    "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ariel_Motor_Company",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": ", with all but a few parts having been changed. The new car is powered again by the engine used in the Honda Civic Type R, but is now turbo charged as standard in the Atom 4. The new car also features a thicker frame, separate seats and a revised intake. The new car has been reviewed by",
    "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ariel_Motor_Company",
    "pass": 3
